  - I'm still trying to figure out if this is a bug or not.  I am Lawful, yet
    Magicbane, Excalibur and the Tsurugi of Whomever all zap me when I wield
    them.

  - Inherent Polymorph (from eating a chameleon) is a pain in the butt...

  - "The accoustics of the Dungeon noticeably change."  What's that message
