  - Nurses can (and do) use wands of Fire.  So much for Healing...

  - What good is being named "Hand of Elbereth"?

  - The identify spell/scroll still needs work.  Try using the "a" option
    someday...  Why can we not have "A" like the other "What do you want"
    prompts?  It'd be nice to go through my pack until I find something I
    don't know what is...

  - There's a bug with the sight algorythms:  I've only noticed it with 
    tunneling dwarves, though.  Occasionally, the dwarf goes invisible, even
    when he's not possessed of a wand, cloak, potion, ring, trap or anything
    else of Invisibility.  It's kind of annoying to be running around in the
    Gnome Mines (with inherent See Invis) and bump into these "invisible"
    dwarves.

  This is all for 3.1, in case that point needs to be made.

